# Build-context excludes for examples/showcase/Dockerfile.
#
# This file MUST sit next to the Dockerfile and be named
# `<dockerfile>.dockerignore`: the build context is the *repository root*
# (see the Dockerfile header), and Docker resolves a bare `.dockerignore`
# relative to the context, not to the Dockerfile. A plain
# `examples/showcase/.dockerignore` is silently ignored by this build.
#
# Everything not listed here is sent to the daemon; these are the large
# regenerable trees the Gleam build does not need.
**/build/
**/_build/
**/node_modules/
**/.git/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
*.log
erl_crash.dump
